            "review_title": "Review at Cha Ca Ha Noi",
            "review_text": "Osborne Christian\nShanghai, China20 contributions\n0\nThis was the best restaurant in Vietnam\nJan 2020\nThis was the best restaurant we were during the time in Vietnam , the food is just amazing and the service is even better . We ordered a lunch set that included few dishes unknown to us , the waitress came to our table and after serving the food they took the time to explain step by step how to eat it , every time we run out of tea in our cups they were really attentive to fill out glass , the place itself is clean in both floors and it looks cozy and well and neat . In general this is a 10/10 we couldn’t find any other place like this in the rest of our trip , if ever have the opportunity for sure will come again .\nRead more\nWritten January 29, 2020",
